WEBVTT

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:01.803
After 50, stop wearing this.

00:00:01.853 --> 00:00:03.015
The red sports cap.

00:00:03.065 --> 00:00:06.269
It hides your face and gives you a teenager’s head.

00:00:06.319 --> 00:00:10.736
And with the grey zip-up cardigan, it looks like a day at the stadium.

00:00:10.786 --> 00:00:12.842
Result: you look ten years older.

00:00:12.892 --> 00:00:14.437
Look. Same man. Same age.

00:00:14.487 --> 00:00:17.054
A brown leather jacket, a navy roll-neck.

00:00:17.104 --> 00:00:20.691
Or a beige sweater over a white shirt, and a thin beanie.

00:00:20.741 --> 00:00:21.839
Ten years younger.

00:00:21.889 --> 00:00:22.988
What do you think?
